# size 8x2
# With a wrap pending, the cursor is past the last column and the operations that act on columns
# act on nothing. All four measured against tmux: a full row followed by any of them is untouched.
#
# Row 1: fill the row, then delete a character.   Row 2: fill it, then erase to end of line.
12345678\e[P
\e[2;1H12345678\e[K
